5,0,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited! I'll be looking for anyone who acts weird or tries to hide things. Let's find the wolf quickly!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I prefer to observe first. I'll be looking for inconsistencies in how people describe their logic.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Toshio. A calm approach is best. I'll help guide us toward a logical conclusion.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Logic is the only way to win. I expect everyone to provide clear reasons for their suspicions.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,Interesting. I'll be watching your reactions to pressure. The way you deflect will tell me everything.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, that sounds scary! But I'm not afraid. I'll just be honest and energetic!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"Honesty is a good baseline, but the wolf will mimic it. We need a way to verify claims.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Exactly. We should establish how we'll handle claims of being the Seer when they arise.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"If someone claims Seer, they must provide a consistent history of their divinations. Anything else is a lie.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, you're very quick to define the rules. It's almost as if you're trying to control the narrative.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,Maybe Asuka is just being helpful! I think we should all just be friends until the voting starts.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"Friendship doesn't find werewolves, Rin. I'll be keeping a close eye on the flow of conversation.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,Let's not start accusing people too early. We need a baseline of behavior first.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, efficiency isn't control. It's simply the most logical way to proceed.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,We'll see. I'm curious to see who starts sweating when the first night's results come in.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready for the night! I hope I find something cool!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
