31,1,1,talk,Rin,,Everyone! I know who the werewolf is! It's Asuka! I saw it in my vision!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"That was fast. Rin, are you sure you're the Seer, or are you just guessing?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It's a very bold claim for the first day. Rin, why should we trust you immediately?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Asuka,,This is absurd. I am a villager. Rin is clearly lying to frame me and create chaos.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"A direct hit on turn one. @Asuka, your reaction is a bit too defensive. @Rin, your confidence is intriguing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm not lying! I'm the Seer! Asuka is the bad wolf! We have to vote her out now!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Rin is the Seer, Asuka is the wolf. If Rin is the wolf, she's trying to execute a villager.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"We should consider if there's a Possessed player trying to protect the wolf. Asuka's logic is sound, but Rin's info is specific.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, thank you. Rin is likely the werewolf attempting a desperate ""first-strike"" strategy to win early.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, you're very quick to defend the possibility of Asuka's innocence. That's a pattern I'm noting.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, why are you helping her? I'm telling the truth! Asuka is the wolf!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"The risk of executing the Seer is high, but the risk of leaving a known wolf is higher.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'm not helping anyone; I'm just weighing the evidence. We have one claim and one denial.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, if you're so logical, you'll see that a real Seer wouldn't reveal themselves so recklessly on Day 1.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Actually, in a small group, speed is a logical advantage. I'm leaning toward Rin's information.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,See! Shion believes me! Let's get the wolf!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I've seen enough. The probability favors the Seer's claim over a fake one this early.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"If the majority is decided, I won't stand in the way of the village's will.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Asuka,,You are all making a grave mistake. You'll regret this when the wolf attacks tonight.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,Your desperation is the final piece of evidence I needed.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
